6.0.2.0

- Apex Legends stays detected during startup.
- League of Legends stops showing as active when a match ends.
- On first run, F11 can't turn Lucid on before you choose a headset.
- Custom Equalizer APO config folders work, and old settings carry over to each Windows account.
- Lucid Voice no longer plays old mic audio when switched back on.
- Other small fixes and optimizations.
